.SH BUGS
The system is the bug. That is the point.

.SH HISTORY
.PP
In 1991, if you could find the phone number, you could find a Unix
box. If you could find a Unix box, you could find a flaw. The phone
numbers got harder. The flaws did not. You are looking at one of the
flaws.
